        {
            "id": "20261119A07LCN00",
            "title": "晓数点丨Anthropic今夜登陆纳斯达克！史上最大IPO来了",
            "image": "https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OtI-OqzV0N_1Uz2kc3z13FtVFLvGFhZFaY7Ycx8JmfQlkAA_870492/0",
            "link": "https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20261119A07LCN00",
            "author": "名扬四海",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-19 12:28:11",
            "description": "<div class=\"rich_media_content\"><p><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OuPFkYagzaSK0Fmnw_hXHmOzZq3XJ8I4Kzw0Ab72chsPwAA/1000\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OuPFkYagzaSK0Fmnw_hXHmOzZq3XJ8I4Kzw0Ab72chsPwAA/1000\" style=\"border-radius:6px;width:100%;height:100%\"/></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OyL_QDspJSl7dS2uassNWZ-HJ0HJTf5WYkQO-CPjdG8-EAA/1000\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OyL_QDspJSl7dS2uassNWZ-HJ0HJTf5WYkQO-CPjdG8-EAA/1000\" style=\"border-radius:6px;width:800px;height:100%\"/></p><section>  (本文来自第一财经)</section></div>",
